    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: a parked bomb (CE-4621 IM-2; docs/designs/vehicle-tactics/DESIGN_Motorcycle.md \u00a75 / \u00a79). A two-up insurgent motorcycle ('Bike': 'Rider', 'Pillion', and an 8 kg 'Bike charge' in its pannier \u2014 the cargo station) rides east along the test-town road from (40, 200) at 12 m/s and parks at the market spot (230, 200) beside two shoppers ('Shopper 1', 'Shopper 2', Neutral). ParkedBomb arms the charge's 70 s timer, puts the riders out and orders them to walk clear: 80 m back the way they came (R-3090). The charge goes off on its timer. Judge: (1) the bike parks at the spot (within 8 m of (230, 200)) (2) the riders get off (3) the charge goes off, after they are off (4) both riders are 40 m or more west of the spot (x < 190) before it goes off (5) both riders are unhurt at the end (6) a shopper beside the bike is hurt. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh ua-moto-parked-bomb"
  },
